- **Breaking change:** Removed the deprecated `/api/v1/fleet/queries`, `/api/v1/fleet/spec/queries`, and `/api/v1/fleet/hosts/:id/queries` endpoints (and the paths under them), `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/id/:id`, and `POST /api/v1/fleet/reports/run_by_names`. They now return `410 Gone` with a link to the Fleet 5 migration guide. Use the equivalent `/reports` endpoints, `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/:id`, and `POST /api/v1/fleet/reports/run_by_identifiers` instead. API-only users' access to `GET /api/v1/fleet/queries/run` and `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/id/:id` moves to `GET /api/v1/fleet/reports/run` and `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/:id`.
